  "summary": "CryptoQNet is a gate-based hybrid quantum-classical cryptocurrency forecasting model using amplitude encoding, quantum feature maps, a variational quantum circuit, and a quantum recurrent neural network. On Bitcoin it reports MAE 0.021 and RMSE 0.028, and on Ethereum MAE 0.018 and RMSE 0.025; volatility prediction MAPE is 3.2% for Bitcoin and 3.6% for Ethereum, all on a quantum simulator and compared against LSTM/GRU baselines.",
